%% UML sequence diagram of the shipped interaction model (Section 4.8).
%% In-canvas interaction (1-4), Connect -> entity-detail (5-8), Close + restore (9-10).
%% MCV-simultaneous brushing is retired; Connect collapses to a single click-to-panel
%% handoff (Yi 2007). The other six Yi categories stay in the View Controls bar.
%% Monochrome theme to match the academic block style for the rest of the report.
%% Render via the render-mermaid.sh script in this directory.

%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'background':'#FFFFFF','primaryColor':'#FFFFFF','primaryTextColor':'#000000','primaryBorderColor':'#000000','lineColor':'#000000','actorBkg':'#FFFFFF','actorBorder':'#000000','actorTextColor':'#000000','actorLineColor':'#000000','noteBkgColor':'#FFFFFF','noteBorderColor':'#000000','noteTextColor':'#000000','signalColor':'#000000','signalTextColor':'#000000','labelBoxBkgColor':'#FFFFFF','labelBoxBorderColor':'#000000','labelTextColor':'#000000','sequenceNumberColor':'#000000','fontFamily':'Helvetica'},'sequence':{'actorMargin':170,'width':190,'actorFontSize':15,'messageFontSize':14,'noteFontSize':14,'boxMargin':8,'mirrorActors':true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U  as User
  participant V  as View Controls<br/>(date + filter bar)
  participant C  as Active canvas<br/>(one chart)
  participant SM as State manager
  participant E  as Entity-detail panel

  Note over U,SM: In-canvas interaction (Select / Reconfigure / Filter)
  U  ->>  V  : adjust date or filter
  V  ->>  SM : write view state
  SM ->>  C  : re-render this canvas
  C  -->> U  : updated chart

  Note over U,E: Connect - one click opens entity-detail
  U  ->>  C  : click entity (route / stop)
  C  ->>  SM : open detail (entity id)
  SM ->>  E  : render panel against view state
  E  -->> U  : mini-charts about that entity

  Note over U,E: Close and restore
  U  ->>  E  : close panel
  E  -->> U  : view state preserved, canvas restored
